OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather dull and grey day.
OL,6,FCloudy this morning with mist and
OL,7,Fpatchy light rain. The rain becomes
OL,8,Fmore widespread this afternoon,
OL,9,Fespecially across eastern areas.
OL,10,FTemperatures around normal, with winds
OL,11,Fremaining light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud with spells of mainly
OL,14,Flight rain for most areas this evening
OL,15,Fand overnight. Perhaps becoming misty,
OL,16,Fwhile remaining relatively mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
